    "key": "B",
    "content": "$6t^{3}$",
    "rationale": "The derivatives $3t^{2}$ and $2t$ must be divided, not multiplied."
   },
   {
    "key": "C",
    "content": "$\\dfrac{3t^{2}}{2}$",
    "rationale": "The t in the denominator 2t has not been cancelled correctly."
   },
   {
    "key": "D",
    "content": "$\\dfrac{3t}{2}$",
    "correct": true,
    "rationale": "Correct: $\\frac{3t^{2}}{2t} = \\frac{3t}{2}$."
   }
  ],
  "explanation": "$\\dfrac{dy}{dx} = \\dfrac{dy/dt}{dx/dt} = \\dfrac{3t^{2}}{2t} = \\dfrac{3t}{2}$ for $t \\neq 0$.",
